1
00:00:00,724 --> 00:00:03,124
I think I started to suspect
it was a bad movie

2
00:00:03,127 --> 00:00:06,967
when I looked at the script
and saw the title,

3
00:00:06,964 --> 00:00:09,764
Serial Ape-ist 2:

4
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:12,737
Monkey See, Monkey Kill.

5
00:00:12,737 --> 00:00:13,837
Uh, spoiler alert:

6
00:00:13,838 --> 00:00:16,768
(Wil:)after the monkey sees, it kills.

7
00:00:16,774 --> 00:00:18,744
(Leonard:)Psst.

8
00:00:18,743 --> 00:00:20,643
(Wil:)I've just been handed a note.

9
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:22,815
(Wil:)I'm going to read it.

10
00:00:22,814 --> 00:00:26,014
"Wil, do you want
more Diet Coke?

11
00:00:27,117 --> 00:00:30,057
Also, we have juice."

12
00:00:31,755 --> 00:00:34,055
I-I didn't want to interrupt.

13
00:00:35,359 --> 00:00:36,859
(Wil:)Uh, that voice you just heard

14
00:00:36,861 --> 00:00:38,661
(Wil:)belongs to Leonard,
Penny's fiancé.

15
00:00:38,663 --> 00:00:40,693
(Wil:)Uh, Leonard, why don't you grab
some headphones and join us?

16
00:00:40,698 --> 00:00:42,298
(Leonard:)Really?
Yeah.

17
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,800
(chuckles) Yeah, great.

18
00:00:43,801 --> 00:00:45,501
(Wil:)So, while Leonard
gets set up,

19
00:00:45,503 --> 00:00:47,003
(Wil:)let's take a call.

20
00:00:47,004 --> 00:00:48,604
(Wil:)Hello, caller, you are on

21
00:00:48,606 --> 00:00:51,006
(Wil:)with Penny and Wil
from Serial Ape-ist 2.

22
00:00:51,008 --> 00:00:52,378
WOMAN:
I don't have a question.

23
00:00:52,377 --> 00:00:54,477
(Caller:)I just want to say
I'm a big fan of the movie.

24
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:56,009
(Caller:)I've seen it, like, ten times.

25
00:00:56,013 --> 00:00:58,513
(Penny:)Okay, well, I'll apologize
for the first time,

